stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Queued : POST /api/v1/coding/submissions
    Queued --> Running : Worker claims job from Redis
    
    state Running {
        [*] --> Compiling : If compiled language (C++, Java)
        Compiling --> CompilationError : Non-zero exit code
        Compiling --> ExecutingCases : Binary ready
        
        state ExecutingCases {
            [*] --> CaseEvaluation
            CaseEvaluation --> CaseEvaluation : Case 1..N passed
            CaseEvaluation --> FirstFailure : Failed on Case K
        }
    }

    ExecutingCases --> Accepted : All cases passed (100%)
    FirstFailure --> WrongAnswer : Output mismatch
    FirstFailure --> TimeLimitExceeded : Wall-clock / CPU limit reached
    FirstFailure --> MemoryLimitExceeded : RAM ceiling exceeded
    FirstFailure --> RuntimeError : Unhandled exception / SIGSEGV
    Running --> SystemError : Worker crash or Piston network drop

    Accepted --> Completed
    WrongAnswer --> Completed
    TimeLimitExceeded --> Completed
    MemoryLimitExceeded --> Completed
    RuntimeError --> Completed
    CompilationError --> Completed
    SystemError --> Failed

    Completed --> [*] : Notify Browser via SSE &amp; Commit to DB
    Failed --> [*] : Notify Browser &amp; Log Incident
